{"id":"a4925851-5819-4148-83a6-29bfadd786bc","object":"chat.completion","created":1785015259,"model":"deepseek-v4-flash","choices":[{"index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\n  \"implementation\": \"def solve(case):\\n    attempts = case['attempts']\\n    max_attempts = case['max_attempts']\\n    n = len(attempts)\\n    for attempt in attempts:\\n        if attempt['success']:\\n            return {\\n                'decision': 'finished',\\n                'memory_append': None,\\n                'next_attempt': n\\n            }\\n    last = attempts[-1]\\n    last_sig = last['failure_signature']\\n    prev_idx = None\\n    for i in range(n - 1):\\n        if attempts[i]['failure_signature'] == last_sig:\\n            prev_idx = i\\n            break\\n    if prev_idx is not None:\\n        return {\\n            'decision': 'revert',\\n            'memory_append': {\\n                'reflection': attempts[prev_idx]['reflection'],\\n                'signature': attempts[prev_idx]['failure_signature']\\n            },\\n            'next_attempt': prev_idx\\n        }\\n    if n >= max_attempts:\\n        return {\\n            'decision': 'give_up',\\n            'memory_append': None,\\n            'next_attempt': n\\n        }\\n    return {\\n        'decision': 'retry',\\n        'memory_append': {\\n            'reflection': last['reflection'],\\n            'signature': last['failure_signature']\\n        },\\n        'next_attempt': n\\n    }\\n\"\n}","reasoning_content":"We need to implement solve(case) for task AGENT-RF-02. The case payload contains:\n- attempts: list of objects with success (bool), failure_signature (string), reflection (string)\n- max_attempts: integer\n- _case_nonce: string (but we don't need to use it)\n\nWe must output a JSON object per the schema:\n- decision: string\n- memory_append: null or object with reflection (string) and signature (string)\n- next_attempt: integer\n\nWe need to determine the decision logic. This